                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "938f5a77-7f01-331a-83d4-94135e1ed74d",
                        "entry_id": "9c7d3ad4-f9c8-32e3-8e70-92ea47b07d27",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualifie un objet ou un service commercialisé sous ce modèle économique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Économie"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "87b00768-cad4-48ed-ba8b-381cbbab0aec",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c7d3ad4-f9c8-32e3-8e70-92ea47b07d27",
                        "source_sense_id": "938f5a77-7f01-331a-83d4-94135e1ed74d",
                        "target_lang_word": "freemium",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "freemium",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05876ad8-a9e1-353e-b0cf-1535b7b8e77f",
                                        "entry_id": "21fe47f0-beea-342d-a28f-dddf3e9bebbb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Offering basic services for free while charging a premium for advanced or special features."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e8e47b7-d6cc-4870-a4e4-d51705ef0868",
                                                "sense_id": "05876ad8-a9e1-353e-b0cf-1535b7b8e77f",
                                                "text": "When framing a business model within the consumer Internet space, we may hear about advertising-supported, freemium, subscription, or a hybrid model."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50c1d7ad-7e87-42a4-b8de-c7f8bac8a905",
                                                "sense_id": "05876ad8-a9e1-353e-b0cf-1535b7b8e77f",
                                                "text": "Regarding premium services, both the \"freemium\" model (free basic service with a premium service offered on a subscription basis) and the free trial model..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8151c97-c76c-4382-9bc3-3386d065987b",
                                                "sense_id": "05876ad8-a9e1-353e-b0cf-1535b7b8e77f",
                                                "text": "Venture capitalist and blogger nonpareil Fred Wilson calls it the \"freemium\" business model: \"Give your service away for free, possibly ad supported but maybe not, acquire a lot of customers efficiently through word of mouth..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "freemium",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d73e6d3-759c-3d3e-a641-05d51d03b7f8",
                                        "entry_id": "70fcd25b-2c28-3a37-abb4-89605d0e0155",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A product that is offered free of charge and supported by sales of a premium version."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "167d338e-a7e9-4c4f-b4cf-cd61494c5f46",
                                                "sense_id": "8d73e6d3-759c-3d3e-a641-05d51d03b7f8",
                                                "text": "Most consumer-level cloud offerings would be labeled a freemium, which is a free version that is supported by a paid, premium version."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0bd74b94-e241-37cf-b055-787f567e9b22",
                                        "entry_id": "70fcd25b-2c28-3a37-abb4-89605d0e0155",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A business model that relies on offering a free version and charging for a premium version."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bce8e256-1791-4fbb-a561-461123da0df5",
                                                "sense_id": "0bd74b94-e241-37cf-b055-787f567e9b22",
                                                "text": "So the only thing left would be using freemium as a means of gaining trial, with the potential to up-sell to a paid subscription."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
